shadow of war is a dense action RPG with  a lot of skills to unlock systems to get  your head around and of course many many  orcs just right there for the killings  our previous tips video focus on the  opening few hours of the game before you  get the ability to bend Oryx to your  will the dominate ability that you get  at the beginning of the second act is a  complete and utter game-changer pardon  the pun so here's a few more tips for  middle-earth shadow of war including how  to get the most out of its famed Nemesis  system number one worms as soon as you  enter a new region in Mordor your first  port of call should be to purify the  three high deer towers to unlock fast  travel points and earn an easy skill  points from there you should hunt out  the worms that will give you valuable  intel on the enemy captains and  WarChiefs something we noticed was that  worms are actually quicker to dominate  than regular orcs so if you're not up  for a fight or you're in a rush to  collect your Intel and plot your attack  on the WarChiefs you can run in dominate  the worm and be out of there in a flash  number two getting higher level  followers once you recruit a knock to  your army there are various ways to  increase his power level to make him  stronger  before you start recruiting make sure  you have wealth gems attached to your  ring of power if you have these attached  any captain new recruit automatically  gains a couple of levels when they join  your side the more powerful the gem the  more levels your captain gains also if  you've been eyeing up a particular app  that you're looking to recruit have a  worm send them a death threat before you  go after them doing this increases the  level of the captain by five they call  it a dance rate but it's flattering to  be wanted  you have three turns to complete these  missions dying completing other nemesis  missions or skipping time ahead at a  high dere tower it takes up a turn if  you choose to do other missions and  don't fulfill the death threat you can  actually send him another one to  increase his power by a further five  levels once recruited you can start  doing missions to increase your orcs  levels sending them to kill enemy  captain's as long  they succeed NAB's a couple levels for  them but the best way for order to leap  up in levels is to use the fighting pits  if you control a region that is you've  completed its fortress assault and  instilled your own overlord you'll have  access to its fighting pits  you can send orcs to face off against  each other in the pits and the winner  gains a good number of levels so if you  want to bring a low level orc up to  yours the best thing to do is send him  right down to the pits if he loses and  dies just track down the captain that  one and recruit him because you'll still  be benefiting from the levels he earned  because he won number three combat  dominate but the dominate ability can  quickly turn the tide in most combat  scenarios when attacking an outpost for  example target the archers first they  can reign pain down on those below and  are less likely to be taken out by enemy  orcs on the ground but when you're being  attacked by enemies from every single  angle there's an easy way to use  dominate to avoid dying call in a  bodyguard or a Cara Gor and then back  off as long as there's someone friendly  to take the heat you can hold down the  dominate button and turn a bunch of orcs  to your side fairly quickly now while  this is happening the orcs seem to slow  down on attacking you often just  standing by idly if you do see an enemy  approaching you you've actually got  quite a lot of leeway before the counter  prompt appears invest in the combat  dominate skill to turn orcs to your side  even faster number four Marion Marion is  the most important currency not only is  it the one that you actually obtain by  playing the game but it's the one that  you use in game you can use it to buy  the lower quality loot boxes but  honestly don't bother you'll find decent  enough items as you run around killing  captains and you need to spend your  marion on more important things like  unlocking gem slots and on siege  defenses and offenses so here's some  easy ways to make a little extra money  as you kill enemy captains and war  Chiefs you'll pick up better and better  pieces of gear don't let your old items  clog up the inventory instead  deconstruct them for Mirian now items  that belong to legendary armor sets  can't be deconstructed nor can epic or  rare items that you've upgraded but  purple drops from legendary orcs can be  dismantled for a substantial amount as  you walk through Mordor you'll come  across these orcs with the white symbol  above their heads signalling that their  treasure carriers make sure to kill them  for some easy Mirian if you're running  low  make sure you've attached wealth gems to  all three of your weapons as these gems  increase the chance that enemies drop  Marian when they die more powerful  wealth gems means a higher chance of a  money drop and finally orcs now belong  to tribes and the tribe of the region's  overlord affect the whole area once you  take over a region and put a new  Overlord in charge his tribe will give  different bonuses so if you need some  extra money  make sure your overlord is a member of  the Marauder tribe these guys love  treasure so they'll leave Marian chests  full of money all around the region for  you to find and loot number 5 the  Nemesis system where shadow of war  really shines is the Nemesis system it's  a dynamic system where the enemy  hierarchy constantly shifts and adjusts  but it's one that also can be completely  manipulated by you orcs constantly  battle each other for power so there are  always openings coming up for your guys  to take up first of all I mentioned it  earlier but remember that these missions  are only active for a limited time after  three turns they get resolved and the  orc that wins encounter increases in  level it's also worth remembering that  unless you directly interfere with these  missions they might not work out in your  armies  if you see one of your followers  embroiled in a nemesis mission you can  send another follower as backup raising  your guys chance of success you can  always pop along too if you want to  dominate the enemy captain instead of  having him die if you get killed by an  enemy orc or even betrayed by one of  your own this happens and it's  devastating you can go get your revenge  choose the vendetta mission and if you  kill whoever took you down you'll get  some better quality loot but easily the  most fun nemesis encounters are betrayal  missions use Intel to determine who a  war Chiefs bodyguards are recruit them  to your side and you can set up an  ambush to take out the war chief by  killing or recruiting the war chief to  your side it disables their associated  defenses at the fortress assaults pretty  much making it a cakewalk number 6  online fortress assaults once you've  taken a fortress in the single-player  don't forget to defend it because it can  be attacked online but ensuring that  it's defended well is an easy way to  earn spoils of war a loot chest that's  guaranteed to contain at least one  legendary follower in the army menu tap  r1 or right bumper to bring up the siege  upgrade menu make sure you have  followers assigned in every open slot  and marién levels permitting the  strongest defenses in place for an extra  bit of Defense assigned bodyguards to  your war Chiefs when the fortress gets  attacked either online or in the game's  defense missions they can help hold on  to defense points for longer by ensuring  that every war chief is in position  there are defenses and there are  bodyguards it increases your defense  rating in online ranked conquests  there's also an attack rating buts based  on how well you attack others fortresses  by participating in online assaults  these ratings increase allowing you to  rank up higher ranks provide a  percentage bonus unspoiled of war gained  from online activities which means the  more you play online the more spoils of  war you get which means more goodies you  get at the end lovely stuff  number seven advanced skills to invest  in over the course of the game you'll  easily earn enough skill points to  unlock all italians abilities but here  the ones that you should prioritize if  you find it mega annoying to have to  hold r1 or right bumper to pick up an  item then treasure hunter allows you to  pick up items just by walking over them  why this is an unlockable skill I have  no idea but it's worth getting as soon  as you can if you want to become one  with the beasts pickup hack master  Shadow Man sing a Kerrigan eights all of  the nearby ones too as long as they  don't have a rider on them meaning that  you'll be leader of the pack in no time  shadow strike is another skill that  takes a weirdly long time to unlock but  once you have it invest in its upgrade  chain of Shadows not only is it one of  the coolest looking skills but it's mega  useful for dropping in on a group of  enemies unannounced and taking them out  one by one and finally Dragon song  complete the qanun quests to be able to  summon in a Drake unlock dragon rider to  basically go full daenerys targaryen on  anyone that dares to stand in your way  so there we are some more tips for  middle-earth shadow of war if you have  any of your own leave them in the  comments box below for more on the game  including our review make sure to keep  your eyes peeled to GameSpot
 

